  unitName: Mira
  unitId: 840155
  unitNumber: 8175
  description: A nun devoted to preaching the gospel, Mira is known as the "Beansprouts
    Sister" in the fabled world of elder runes. Although she is always eager to gather
    new followers, she ultimately exploits them to cover her tremendous apparel expenses.
    Left with little money afterwards, she resorts to eating beansprouts everyday
    to survive. Curiously enough, it is rumored she hides an even darker secret behind
    her enthusiastic demeanor...
  summonDesc: Welcome to our family, Summoner!<br>Don't forget your daily offerings!<br>Contributing
    is important...
  fusionDesc: Thank you for your donations!<br>They will go towards a good cause...<br>Like
    my wardrobe!
